Source: prefixlimit
Section: httpd
Priority: optional
Maintainer: flo <f@zz.de>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), apache2-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: libapache2-mod-prefixlimit
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Apache module to rate limit client networks by URI prefix
 mod_prefixlimit classifies clients using a YAML list of CIDR prefixes
 (IPv4 and IPv6) and applies a token bucket rate limit per class and
 location. Over-limit requests get 429 with a Retry-After header.
